> Dear S users,
>
> I am conducting a logistic regression (lrm) using the Design library.
>
> I have a categorical dependent variable and I will like to change de
> reference value in the model.

There is no need to change the reference value when fitting the model. 
All estimates should come from summary( ), contrast( ), predict( ), and 
for those it is very easy to use any category of your choice as the 
reference value.  summary( ) defaults to the modal category but do 
?summary.Design to see how to use others quite easily.

Frank Harrell

